| description = The Deep Muses are found in the Hall of Deep Musing in Ak'Anon.  This combined Cleric and Rogue guild is lead by the unlikely partnership of the Cleric Iony Gredlong and the Rogue Welno Tanboots.  The Deep Muses are in general peaceful, but do support both the [[Gem Choppers]] and the [[Merchants of AkAnon]].  The Deep Muses have little to do in the affairs of the land, offering only the starting quest to young rogues and clerics.

